{'symbol': 'DAL', 'date': '2022-10-11 06:00:00', 'title': 'DELTA,\xa0JOBY\xa0AVIATION PARTNER\xa0TO PIONEER\xa0HOME-TO-AIRPORT\xa0TRANSPORTATION\xa0TO CUSTOMERS', 'text': 'SANTA CRUZ, CALIF. & ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--DELTA AIR LINES (NYSE: DAL) IS ONCE AGAIN DEEPENING ITS COMMITMENT TO TRANSFORM THE FUTURE OF TRAVEL: THE AIRLINE IS EMBARKING ON A MULTI-YEAR, MULTI-MARKET COMMERCIAL AND OPERATIONAL PARTNERSHIP WITH JOBY AVIATION, INC. (NYSE: JOBY), TO DELIVER TRANSFORMATIONAL, SUSTAINABLE HOME-TO-AIRPORT TRANSPORTATION SERVICE TO DELTA CUSTOMERS, BEGINNING IN NEW YORK AND LOS ANGELES. AS PART OF THE FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND ARRANGEMENT, THE COMPANIES WILL WORK TOGETHER'}